  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Trade Competitiveness in the East African Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased trade competitiveness in East Africa through TradeMark East Africa Tanzania Country Project Strategy 2017/18 - 2022/23. TMEA objectives are (1) Reduced barriers to trade (2) Impoved business competitiveness for trade</narrative>
  </description>
